  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nyekorac Maize Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: maize .Beneficiaries: 3200 smallholder farmers (1200 male and 2000 female).The project will provide Nyekorac with a grain storage facility, post-harvest and value addition equipment, and working capital to enable the cooperative bulk produce as well as procure quality inputs.</narrative>
  </description>
